WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:14.935
All three: Ahhhhhh!

2
00:00:14.936 --> 00:00:23.569
Brad: Everybody, jump out of the way!

3
00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.795
Brad: That was close!

4
00:00:25.796 --> 00:00:30.325
Tina: Too close!

5
00:00:30.326 --> 00:00:32.001
Bello: Look!

6
00:00:32.002 --> 00:00:34.842
Danny: The evil dragonfly is stuck!

7
00:00:34.843 --> 00:00:38.017
Brad: Quick! We have to think of a way to defeat it.

8
00:00:38.018 --> 00:00:44.159
Tina: Yes. It won’t stay stuck forever.

9
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:56.753
Danny: Let’s see how it feels about color!

10
00:00:56.754 --> 00:00:59.154
Tina: I don’t think it’s happy.

11
00:00:59.155 --> 00:01:01.527
Brad: I think it’s trying to get loose.

12
00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:11.266
Danny: I guess that was a bad idea.

13
00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:13.301
Brad: It’s attacking again!

14
00:01:13.302 --> 00:01:16.330
Danny: We’re in big trouble!

15
00:01:16.331 --> 00:01:22.585
Tina: Run!

16
00:01:22.586 --> 00:01:25.565
Tina: Ow!

17
00:01:25.566 --> 00:01:27.183
Danny: What’s the matter?

18
00:01:27.184 --> 00:01:30.933
Tina: I fell on the crayons in my back pocket.

19
00:01:30.934 --> 00:01:32.797
Danny: Crayons! That’s it!

20
00:01:32.798 --> 00:01:34.390
Brad: What do you mean?

21
00:01:34.391 --> 00:01:38.102
Danny: Just wait.

22
00:01:38.103 --> 00:01:39.989
Tina: What are you making?

23
00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:43.708
Danny: Something that will defeat that evil dragonfly.

24
00:01:43.709 --> 00:01:46.982
Brad: Pea shooters?

25
00:01:46.983 --> 00:01:50.555
Tina: Danny, I think you used normal clay.

26
00:01:50.556 --> 00:01:54.471
Danny: I know. We can use them to shoot the crayons!

27
00:01:54.472 --> 00:01:56.660
Tina: Great thinking, Danny!

28
00:01:56.661 --> 00:01:59.771
Brad: Quick, Tina. Hand out the crayons.

29
00:01:59.772 --> 00:02:01.754
Tina: Here.

30
00:02:01.755 --> 00:02:04.651
Danny: You guys hide in the flowers with Bello.

31
00:02:04.652 --> 00:02:06.488
Tina: Where are you going?

32
00:02:06.489 --> 00:02:08.693
Danny: I’m going to run up ahead.

33
00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:10.001
Brad: I get it.

34
00:02:10.002 --> 00:02:12.346
The dragonfly will chase you.

35
00:02:12.347 --> 00:02:15.851
As it flies by, we can fire at it.

36
00:02:15.852 --> 00:02:23.517
Brad: It’s attacking again!

37
00:02:23.518 --> 00:02:33.215
Danny: Get ready . . . fire!

38
00:02:33.216 --> 00:02:39.178
Brad: It’s working!

39
00:02:39.179 --> 00:02:45.852
Danny: You’ve almost done it!

40
00:02:45.853 --> 00:02:48.522
Danny: Oh no, the fangs!

41
00:02:48.523 --> 00:02:56.388
Over here, over here!

42
00:02:56.389 --> 00:02:58.256
Danny: That was close.

43
00:02:58.257 --> 00:03:11.451
It’s my turn to return fire!

44
00:03:11.452 --> 00:03:14.681
Brad: I’m glad that buzzing has stopped.

45
00:03:14.682 --> 00:03:18.996
Tina: A wise man once said, “Silence is golden.”

46
00:03:18.997 --> 00:03:25.509
Danny: I know. Teachers tell me that all the time.

47
00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:28.972
Brad: I don’t think anything can stop us now.

48
00:03:28.973 --> 00:03:33.877
Bello: Look.
